WEBVTT

1
00:00:07,150 --> 00:00:08,990
Your Majesty, the matter has been found out

2
00:00:11,120 --> 00:00:13,800
Who is behind the scenes in Fangyang? This afternoon

3
00:00:14,280 --> 00:00:15,920
His Majesty visited the Cao Yun Alliance headquarters in person

4
00:00:16,320 --> 00:00:17,720
Brought away a large amount of silver grain

5
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:21,410
This is news from the Poison Tea Garden

6
00:00:21,610 --> 00:00:28,380
How could it be His Majesty?

7
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:36,630
When you want to take advantage of this prodigal?

8
00:00:36,830 --> 00:00:40,100
It is impossible for Cao Yun to take it back

9
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:42,900
Cao Yun is in the court

10
00:00:42,900 --> 00:00:44,620
It's always been a big hole

11
00:00:45,140 --> 00:00:47,680
Nowadays, the imperial court's tax revenue is mainly used to prove that it is gold.

12
00:00:48,290 --> 00:00:50,250
How could His Majesty take it back?

13
00:00:50,530 --> 00:00:55,820
And even if you take it back

14
00:00:56,260 --> 00:00:58,520
I won't use that loser either.

15
00:00:58,840 --> 00:01:08,050
The reason why I used Fangyang to do this

16
00:01:08,250 --> 00:01:11,250
I just want to keep the money in my own library
